The original inference models are converted to ONNX with paddle2onnx and their
character dictionary is extracted to JSON. No model training or quantization is
performed. Source and output hashes and conversion versions are recorded in the
installed manifest.json. The C++ pipeline implements the PaddleOCR BGR
normalization, DB quad postprocessing and CTC decoding; its floating-point
rectangle expansion differs from the reference's integer pyclipper offset.

ONNX Runtime is distributed with its upstream LICENSE and ThirdPartyNotices.txt
in the sibling onnxruntime license directory. Qt and OpenCV are system libraries,
not bundled here. No Live2D SDK or Python environment is included in this package.
